 "lab": {
  "title": "Маршрутизация между VLAN",
  "text": "PC1 работает во VLAN 10 (192.168.10.0/24), PC2 во VLAN 20 (192.168.20.0/24). Настройте маршрутизацию между VLAN по схеме «маршрутизатор на палочке» (router-on-a-stick).\n\n1. На **SW1** создайте VLAN 10 и 20, переведите Fa0/1 во VLAN 10, Fa0/2 во VLAN 20, а Fa0/24 сделайте транком.\n2. На **R1** включите Gi0/0 и создайте подынтерфейсы Gi0/0.10 и Gi0/0.20 с инкапсуляцией dot1Q и адресами .1 в каждой сети.\n3. Проверьте ping с PC1 на PC2.",
  "checks": [
   "vlan SW1 10 | На SW1 есть VLAN 10",
   "vlan SW1 20 | На SW1 есть VLAN 20",
   "ip R1 192.168.10.1 | Шлюз VLAN 10 на R1",
   "ip R1 192.168.20.1 | Шлюз VLAN 20 на R1",
   "ping PC1 192.168.10.1 | PC1 видит свой шлюз",
   "ping PC1 192.168.20.10 | PC1 видит PC2 через R1"
  ],
  "translations": {
   "en": {
    "title": "Inter-VLAN routing",
    "text": "PC1 is in VLAN 10 (192.168.10.0/24), PC2 in VLAN 20 (192.168.20.0/24). Route between the VLANs with a router-on-a-stick.\n\n1. On **SW1** create VLANs 10 and 20, put Fa0/1 in VLAN 10 and Fa0/2 in VLAN 20, and make Fa0/24 a trunk.\n2. On **R1** enable Gi0/0 and create subinterfaces Gi0/0.10 and Gi0/0.20 with dot1Q encapsulation and the .1 address in each network.\n3. Ping PC2 from PC1.",
    "checks": [
     "SW1 has VLAN 10",
     "SW1 has VLAN 20",
     "VLAN 10 gateway on R1",
     "VLAN 20 gateway on R1",
     "PC1 reaches its gateway",
     "PC1 reaches PC2 through R1"
    ]
   }
  },
  "solution": "Транк до маршрутизатора и подынтерфейсы dot1Q.",
  "script": {
   "SW1": "enable\nconfigure terminal\nvlan 10\nvlan 20\nexit\ninterface fa0/1\nswitchport mode access\nswitchport access vlan 10\ninterface fa0/2\nswitchport mode access\nswitchport access vlan 20\ninterface fa0/24\nswitchport mode trunk\nend",
   "R1": "enable\nconfigure terminal\ninterface gi0/0\nno shutdown\ninterface gi0/0.10\nencapsulation dot1Q 10\nip address 192.168.10.1 255.255.255.0\ninterface gi0/0.20\nencapsulation dot1Q 20\nip address 192.168.20.1 255.255.255.0\nend"
  }
 }
}